   "text": "§2 of docs/02-algorithms.md  ·  RFC 5286 §3.5 (MUST NOT), RFC 7490 §5.4  ·  DECISIONS.md D16, D17  ·  code: src/engine/lfa.ts (MAX_METRIC, computeLfa → skipped)",
