   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 79190,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The rule: skip N if the link either way has the max metric",
   "originalText": "The rule: skip N if the link either way has the max metric",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b06-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 638,
   "height": 23,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "skip N   ⇔   c(S,N) = 16,777,215   or   c(N,S) = 16,777,215",
   "originalText": "skip N   ⇔   c(S,N) = 16,777,215   or   c(N,S) = 16,777,215",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b06-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 199,
   "width": 981,
   "height": 128,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  16,777,215 (2²⁴ − 1) is the highest IS-IS wide metric. Operators set it to drain a link, e.g. before\n   maintenance.\n•  RFC 5286 §3.5: S MUST NOT consider such an N as an alternate, even if it passes every inequality.\n•  Checked in both directions: either one means the operator doesn’t want traffic on that link.\n•  The skip happens first, so N is not a candidate at all. Explain says: Via N: skipped, link S–N has\n   the maximum metric 16777215.",
   "originalText": "•  16,777,215 (2²⁴ − 1) is the highest IS-IS wide metric. Operators set it to drain a link, e.g. before\n   maintenance.\n•  RFC 5286 §3.5: S MUST NOT consider such an N as an alternate, even if it passes every inequality.\n•  Checked in both directions: either one means the operator doesn’t want traffic on that link.\n•  The skip happens first, so N is not a candidate at all. Explain says: Via N: skipped, link S–N has\n   the maximum metric 16777215.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b06-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 337,
   "width": 575,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Worked checks (from the engine, S → D, link S–E fails)",
   "originalText": "Worked checks (from the engine, S → D, link S–E fails)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b06-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 371,
   "width": 866,
   "height": 123,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "S–N metric           LFA                           Remote LFA                 TI-LFA\n-------------------  ----------------------------  -------------------------  -------------------------\n15 (Example 1)       N  (10 < 15 + 20 = 35  ✓)     not needed                 [PrefixSID(D)], cost 25\nmax both ways        none: N skipped               none: no PQ node           [PrefixSID(D)] out via N,\n                     (would pass: 10 < 30 + 20)    (N: 30 < 10 + 20 = 30 ✗)   cost 16,777,225\nmax N→S only         none: N skipped               PQ N, cost 15              [PrefixSID(D)], cost 25\n                     (would pass: 10 < 30 + 20)    (N: 15 < 10 + 20 = 30 ✓)",
   "originalText": "S–N metric           LFA                           Remote LFA                 TI-LFA\n-------------------  ----------------------------  -------------------------  -------------------------\n15 (Example 1)       N  (10 < 15 + 20 = 35  ✓)     not needed                 [PrefixSID(D)], cost 25\nmax both ways        none: N skipped               none: no PQ node           [PrefixSID(D)] out via N,\n                     (would pass: 10 < 30 + 20)    (N: 30 < 10 + 20 = 30 ✗)   cost 16,777,225\nmax N→S only         none: N skipped               PQ N, cost 15              [PrefixSID(D)], cost 25\n                     (would pass: 10 < 30 + 20)    (N: 15 < 10 + 20 = 30 ✓)",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b06-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 504,
   "width": 977,
   "height": 60,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e03131",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Max both ways: dist(S,N) and dist(N,S) become 30 (round via E and D), so N leaves P-space too. TI-LFA still\nrepairs over S–N, because SPF still uses max-metric links. RFC 5305 §3.7 says it shouldn’t: this is logged as\nan open item in DECISIONS.md D16.",
   "originalText": "Max both ways: dist(S,N) and dist(N,S) become 30 (round via E and D), so N leaves P-space too. TI-LFA still\nrepairs over S–N, because SPF still uses max-metric links. RFC 5305 §3.7 says it shouldn’t: this is logged as\nan open item in DECISIONS.md D16.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b06-text-16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 574,
   "width": 977,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 126704,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1675664,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Max N→S only: S still reaches N for 15, so plain P-space holds N and the Remote LFA tunnel goes out over S→N.\nRFC 7490 §5.4 only bars N as an extended-P-space exit (D17).",
   "originalText": "Max N→S only: S still reaches N for 15, so plain P-space holds N and the Remote LFA tunnel goes out over S→N.\nRFC 7490 §5.4 only bars N as an extended-P-space exit (D17).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
