   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  ECMP (B2): an excluded neighbor that is a normal\n   next hop still counts. That is normal forwarding,\n   not an alternate.\n•  Remote LFA: only the extended-P-space exits are\n   skipped (D17).\n•  TI-LFA: the post-convergence path is plain SPF\n   without S–E.",
   "originalText": "•  ECMP (B2): an excluded neighbor that is a normal\n   next hop still counts. That is normal forwarding,\n   not an alternate.\n•  Remote LFA: only the extended-P-space exits are\n   skipped (D17).\n•  TI-LFA: the post-convergence path is plain SPF\n   without S–E.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
